<title>PHILIPPINES: Acer said to infuse $60 mln in Subic plant.</title>
<headline>Acer said to infuse $60 mln in Subic plant.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Acer Inc is infusing an additional $60 million in its manufacturing facility inside the Philippines' Subic freeport area, the Subic Bay Metropolitan Authority (SBMA) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Acer is investing $50 million to build a new 15-hectare manufacturing plant, while another $10 million will be set aside to expand its motherboard production facility at its present site, SBMA said in a statement, quoting Acer Information Products Philippines general manager Kenny Wang</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
